---
// How I work: from inside the business, one at a time. Direct, no hedging.
---
<section id="how" class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head rv">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> How I work</p>
      <h2>From inside your business, one at a time.</h2>
      <p class="lead">I work from inside your organization. I see where the day gets stuck, build what is missing, and stay until it runs on its own.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hw">
      <ol class="hw-steps rv">
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3>I start on your floor.</h3>
            <p>Days at the front desk, in the testing rooms and in the exam lanes, writing down what people re-type, re-check, or walk down the hall to find out.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3>I build what is missing.</h3>
            <p>One piece at a time, in weeks. Staff use it early and tell me what to change, and I adjust it until it feels natural.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3>It works alongside what you already have.</h3>
            <p>Nothing is replaced and nobody learns a new system. Your information stays inside your organization.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3>I stay involved.</h3>
            <p>Once it is running I keep an eye on it, and I build the next piece when you are ready.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <div class="hw-side rv">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Right now</h3>
          <div class="hw-status">
            <div class="row"><span>Working with</span><b>Tri-City Eye Care, Kitchener, Ontario</b></div>
            <div class="row"><span>Since</span><b>2026</b></div>
            <div class="row"><span>Systems</span><b>OSCAR EMR, and whatever you run</b></div>
            <div class="row"><span>Next opening</span><b>2027</b></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>A good fit</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>A clinic, pharmacy, lab or office where people are the glue between systems.</li>
            <li>An owner or manager who wants hours back every day.</li>
            <li>A team ready for small changes that add up.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
